From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:40:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] virtio: expose the desktop GPU through MMIO

Port the GPU transport from Droid-VM cb17c72e3 and 1ef32747d,
including the lifecycle callback from 35255ec95. Keep the existing
GPU page at 0x0a000000, level interrupt and queue-notify datamatch.
Unsupported host-visible mappings return an error without a PCI
shared-memory mapper.

BUG=None
TEST=ARM64 Linux, shared-memory and full macOS argument matrices
TEST=MMIO GPU registers and worker lifecycle unit test

Purpose: Expose the desktop GPU through MMIO.
Origin: Droid-VM/crosvm commits cited above.
Upstream-Status: Downstream GunyahVM carry; not submitted to crosvm upstream.
